            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi alipokuwa akiwashika Petro na Yohana, watu wote wakawakusanyikia mbio katika tao lile lililoitwa tao la Sulemani, wakishangaa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati Petro alipoyaona haya akawajibu wale watu, Enyi Waisraeli, mbona mnastaajabia haya, au mbona mnatukazia macho sisi, kana kwamba tumemfanya huyu aende kwa nguvu zetu sisi, au kwa utauwa wetu sisi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
