                  "text": "Lk 24:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lakini mambo yale aliyohubiri Mungu tangu zamani kwa kinywa cha manabii wake wote, ya kwamba Kristo wake atateswa, ameyatimiza hivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
